From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pear <pear@localhost>
Date: Mon, 17 Sep 2001 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [model] feat: model.liger_kwargs, keyword arguments for
 Liger's kernel patching

The FSDP engine passes model.liger_kwargs to Liger's _apply_liger_kernel_to_instance on top of its own
fused_linear_cross_entropy=False and swiglu=True; rms_norm: false, for example, keeps the model's own RMSNorm.
